"""Музыка: a music service, playing in the background.

Two sections, chosen in the header: the home (the house) shows rows of what
the service offers, Моя волна and its modes, one's collection, the chart,
new releases and picks, as covers to tap; Обзор goes through the service's
folders, one list at a time, and ← goes back. A tap only ever opens: music
starts when one taps a track in a list or «▶ Слушать» on a list or a radio.
A radio (Моя волна) plays on and on, fetching more as it goes, and its list
grows with it. The search field finds tracks. A heart on a track puts it
into Мне нравится or takes it out. The gear opens the settings
(~/.config/haltia/music.conf): Источники, a card per service, switched on
or off, signing in and out; the sound quality of each, the lowest unless
chosen. With more than one switched on, a button in the header names the
service the pages show and goes to the next. The bar at the bottom shows
the track and holds its heart, back, pause and on, and the time bar seeks.

Pages opened stay built until one goes back past them, so ← is at once and
where one left it. The service's answers are kept in memory and on disk
(~/.cache/haltia-music/data-<service>.json): a page shows what was known at once and
asks the service again when that is older than a quarter of an hour. Covers
are kept on disk and, decoded, in memory.

Signing in, in the service's card, shows a QR code to scan with the phone
and a code to enter at the service's page, whichever is easier; a service
not signed in shows the way there instead of its pages.

The music goes on while other programs are in front; closing the window
stops it and quits. While it plays (not paused) a logind inhibitor keeps
the machine from sleeping when the screen goes off; the screen may go off.
What plays is told to the desktop by MPRIS, so the Haltia shell marks the
program's button and can pause or stop the music.

Services are the sources package next to this file (or in
PREFIX/lib/haltia-music): Яндекс Музыка now, others the same way. Playback
is libmpv through haltia-kit, sound only. Before 2.0 the program was
b8k-music: its folders move to the new name at the first start.
"""
